<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n50690" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vēsīca</span></b>  (in MSS. often <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vensīca</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vessīca</span></b> ),
		ae, f., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>the bladder</i> in the body of animals, <i>the urinary bladder.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>, <i><span class="en">Plaut.
				Pers. 1, 3, 18</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Cic. Fin.
				2, 30, 96</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. 30, 8, 21, § 65</span></i>;
				<i><span class="en">Hor.
				S. 1, 8, 46</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Petr. 27</span></i>;
					<i><span class="en">App. M. 1, p. 108,
			30</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<i>Any thing made of bladder</i>, e. g. <i>a purse</i>, <i>cap</i>, <i>lantern</i>, <i>foot-ball</i>, etc.,
				<i><span class="en">Varr. R. R. 3, 17, 2</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Ov. M. 15,
				304</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Mart. 8, 33, 19</span></i>; <i><span class="en">8, 14, 62</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">faciem laxis vesicis inligant,</span>”
				<i>as a kind of mask to exclude poisonous
					particles</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					33, 7, 40, § 122</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Sen. Q. N. 2, 27, 2</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Cels. 3,
			21</span></i>; <i><span class="en">3, 27,
			2</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<i>A bladder-like tumor</i>, <i>blister</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 20, 6, 23, §
			51</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>C.</b> =
			pudendum muliebre, <i><span class="en">Juv. 1, 39</span></i>; <i><span class="en">6,
			64</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>III.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>, <i>inflation</i> of
			language, <i>bombast</i>, = tumor, <i><span class="en">Mart. 4,
				49, 7</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
